---
description: Write exhibition labels that preserve crucial provenance and interpretation qualifications within space limits.
args: { dossier: ExhibitionDossier; change: ExhibitionChange; arguments: NarrativeSupport[]; zones: VisitorContextEdge[] }
returns: ExhibitionLabel[]
---
Bind every claim to its evidence-bearing artifact and keep its provenance limits. Shorten repetition before removing qualifications, uncertainty or competing interpretation. Apply community restrictions consistently to gallery labels, images, online previews and promotional copies. Unclear restrictions require community review before any derivative is released.
